Arena Breach - Asset Licenses
=============================

Engine
------
raylib 6.2 — zlib/libpng license
https://github.com/raysan5/raylib

3D Models (assets/models/*.glb)
-------------------------------
Source: Quaternius free packs (via quaternius-showcase mirrors)
License: CC0 1.0 — free for personal and commercial use, attribution not required
Packs used:
- Platformer Game Pack (player Character_Gun, Bee, Crab, Character)
- Easy Enemies Pack (Frog, Rat, Snake, Spider, Wasp)
- Animals Pack (Wolf, Fox, Husky, Bull, Deer, Stag)
- Dinosaurs Pack (Velociraptor, T-Rex, Triceratops, Stegosaurus, Parasaurolophus)
- Cyberpunk Pack (Enemy_* variants)
- Mech Pack (George, Leela, Mike, Stan)

Upstream: https://quaternius.com
Showcase mirror: https://github.com/trebeljahr/quaternius-showcase

Fonts (assets/fonts/)
---------------------
NanumGothic.ttf — SIL Open Font License (OFL), commercial use allowed
https://github.com/google/fonts (ofl/nanumgothic)

Buildings (assets/models/buildings/)
------------------------------------
Quaternius Buildings Pack 2 — CC0
https://quaternius.com

Sound effects (assets/sfx/)
---------------------------
See assets/sfx/LICENSE.txt
- Kenney Starter Kit OGG files: CC0 1.0 (commercial OK)
- grenade.wav / boss.wav / pause.wav: original generated WAV (no third-party IP)

Item icons
----------
Generated at runtime in assets.c (original, no third-party IP)

Game code / names
-----------------
Monster display names and special abilities are original to this project and
are not affiliated with any film/game franchise IP.
